flowchart TD
    U[User] --> P[Enter Music Preferences]
    P --> UI[Streamlit App or CLI]

    CSV[(data/songs.csv)] --> L[Song Loader]
    L --> R[Recommendation Engine]
    UI --> R

    R --> S[Ranked Songs and Recommendation Scores]
    S --> E[Reliability Evaluator]
    P --> E

    E --> Q[Calculate Matching Score]
    Q --> D{Matching Score >= 60%?}

    D -->|Yes| G[Good Match]
    D -->|No| W[Weak Match Warning]

    G --> OUT[Display Recommendations and Explanations]
    W --> OUT

    OUT --> H[User Reviews Results]
    H -.-> P

    E --> LOG[(vibefinder.log)]

    T[Automated Tests] -.-> R
    T -.-> E
    T --> TR[Test Results]